{"id":"vod_zy360_67788","vodId":"67788","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"漆黑的子弹","name_cn":"漆黑的子弹","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全13集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241107-1/55260e77a977e146efe55c6bed1ade88.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在遥远的二零二零年，在同神秘生物“原肠动物”的战争中，人类首次尝到了彻底失败的滋味，土地被剥夺，权利被压榨，在冷酷的独裁统治之下，人类被迫过起了苟且偷生的压抑生活。然而，即便如此，坚强的人们仍然没有放弃反抗的机会，为了对抗强大的敌人，“天童民间警备公司”成立了。表面看来，里见莲太郎（梶裕贵配音）只是一介平凡的十六岁告众人，可实际上，他年纪轻轻就已经成为了“民警”中的一员，在搭档蓝原延珠（日高里菜配音）的帮助下，莲太郎决定要找到莫名死亡的父母的真正死因。一个绝密任务的出现将莲太郎带往了巨大谜团的中心，在危险和杀戮之中，他最终会得到怎样的真相？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-07 16:53:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/TVVBU7Ce/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/VJV0ESrg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/JTQsqbdT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/CJfKxjCI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/Uh0Z8aHA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/BDNIIxMa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/Mv5cmp3z/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/2PLXV8QO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/bd1usqP7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/zJoTUDEN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/vwAYvKup/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/QNmeSn0h/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241107/2UMYtib6/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:48.347Z"}